    <string name="onboarding_tagline">Privacy-first voice dictation keyboard. Speech stays on this device.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_how_title">Enable the keyboard</string>
    <string name="onboarding_steps">1. Grant the microphone below.\n2. Open keyboard settings and turn on JustSpeak.\n3. In any app’s text field, switch the input method to JustSpeak.\n4. Tap the mic, then Insert.\n\nPath: Settings → System → Languages &amp; input → On-screen keyboard → Manage keyboards → JustSpeak.\nOEM wording varies (Samsung: Settings → General management → Keyboard list).</string>
    <string name="onboarding_privacy">No account. No cloud ASR in this build. Day 1 emits placeholder text so the insert path can be tested; Day 3 swaps in on-device Whisper English.</string>
